  "title": "AudioEffect",
  "description": "Abstract base for all insertable audio effects in ExoJS. Each effect exposes stable inputNode and outputNode AudioNodes that an AudioBus or Voice connects into the Web Audio graph. An effect builds its nodes through AudioEffect._deferSetup, which runs as soon as the shared AudioContext is ready. Until then the effect is not wired into any graph, and ready stays pending.",
